Functions with untyped parameters return python_value_type (tagged
union). When the caller assigns to a typed variable, the typecast
from tagged union to the target type loses information or produces
nondet. Fix: improve unwrap_value to handle more target types, or
infer return type from call-site context. Affects ~29 ESBMC tests.
